{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-06-02 16:15:00', 'title': 'SWEP RECEIVES AHRI CERTIFICATION PERFORMANCE AWARD', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., JUNE 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SWEP, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV),\xa0HAS RECEIVED THE AIR-CONDITIONING, HEATING, AND REFRIGERATION INSTITUTE'S (AHRI) CERTIFICATION PERFORMANCE AWARD RECOGNIZING SWEP'S TEST SUCCESS RATES FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR."}